WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:03.830
What happens when paper plates are placed
into the Clockworks?

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:10.080
Dr. Scott prepared 15 paper plates for testing
with SCP-914 on the setting "Very Fine."

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:14.590
The output produced was 15 paper plates that
resembled pepperoni pizza.

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:18.330
The plates gave off a pizza-like smell, and
were also edible.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:22.250
Subjects who taste tested the plates said
they were "delicious."

